abstract: >-
  Public audit record for a private Codex Skill that revises Chinese and English academic prose
  while preserving evidence, numbers, citations, uncertainty, and claim strength. The published
  benchmark is a bounded synthetic generic-filler diagnostic and is not an AI detector.
